          "date": "2026-10-30 22:13:46.000000000",
          "tz": -240
        },
        "subject": "LU-17000 target: bound reply MD size from client eadatasize",
        "message": "LU-17000 target: bound reply MD size from client eadatasize\n\ntgt_handle_request0() sizes the RMF_MDT_MD reply buffer directly\nfrom mbo_eadatasize in the request body, but the value is only\na hint for the reply buffer size, and no target stores an EA\nlarger than OBD_MAX_EA_SIZE, so check the requested\nsize against that limit and use the smaller of the two.\nAlso bound the readlink length in mdt_getattr_internal() by\nthe actual reply buffer size.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:Opus-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I492f9714ce4a7a26b8316cca7fba0efbffc1368d\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
